                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 22,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Washington Republicans cut nearly a trillion dollars from Medicaid to pay for more tax breaks for billionaires. Now, more than 100,000 Nevadans are at risk of losing their health care coverage.\n\nIt\u2019s a shameful betrayal of hardworking families.",
