                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Washington Republicans passed the biggest health care cuts in our nation\u2019s history to pay for more tax breaks for billionaires.\n\nNow, 15 million+ Americans could lose their health care coverage, millions more will pay higher premiums, and hundreds of rural hospitals could be forced to close.",
