                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Some Nevadans get health insurance through their employer and others have Medicaid or Medicare \u2013 but many Nevadans don\u2019t fit into either category and rely on premium tax credits to help them afford coverage through the ACA marketplace.\n\nThe enhanced premium tax credits Democrats created are set to expire, and I hope Senate Republicans will join in a bipartisan effort to keep health coverage affordable.",
