                "reply_count": 13,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Over 100,000 Nevadans get their health insurance through Nevada Health Link \u2013 and when enhanced premium tax credits expire at the end of this year, costs will go up and tens of thousands of people could eventually lose coverage.\n\nCongress must act NOW to protect Nevadans\u2019 access to care.",
