                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Washington Republicans bent over backwards to give more tax breaks to billionaires.\n\nWhy would they rather shut down the government than work with us to stop YOUR health insurance premiums from doubling? https://t.co/TLZDPmseJT",
