                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 34,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our health care system is broken. Accessing care is already too expensive for far too many Americans.\n\nThe last thing we should be doing is making premiums even higher \u2013 but Washington Republicans shut down the government to do just that. We won\u2019t let them get away with it.",
