                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Health insurance premiums are about to go up by thousands of dollars a year for millions of American families.\n\nCongress has the power to stop this. We need Washington Republicans to join us, end the shutdown, and put people over politics. https://t.co/X9pSGrp2iP",
