                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 38,
                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "There is a health care crisis happening RIGHT NOW in our country.\n\nI\u2019m fighting for Nevadans like Tiffany from Sparks who can\u2019t afford to have their premiums double. She deserves to be able to see a doctor and afford her prescriptions \u2013 and so do all Americans. That\u2019s why I won\u2019t back down until we act to prevent health care costs from spiking.",
